        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wheel loader, 6t, 50kW, diesel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wheel loader, 6t, 50kW, diesel
Modern European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: fcde0fea-d93d-4d9d-944d-f4b4a535a633
This process represents the operation of a wheel loader for one hour in Switzerland and includes diesel combustion and the associated building machine demand as subprocesses. Specific diesel demand, service life time, operation weight and annual operating hours have been taken into account. Waste disposal processes are not included in the scope of this dataset.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Operation of a wheel loader, -6 t, 50 kW using diesel as fuel.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fcde0fea-d93d-4d9d-944d-f4b4a535a633.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
